OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 57, arrested over death in
OL,4,Asuspected shooting in Armadale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 57-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fover a man's death in a suspected
OL,8,Fshooting at a house in West Lothian.
OL,10,FWilliam Watson, known as Billy, died at
OL,11,Fthe scene of the incident on Harestanes
OL,12,FRoad, Armadale, at about 11:50 on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FPolice Scotland described the
OL,16,F35-year-old's death as a "targeted
OL,17,Fattack" and said its inquiries were
OL,18,Fongoing.
OL,20,FA postmortem examination is due to take
OL,21,Fplace, and the death is currently being
OL,22,Ftreated as suspicious.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
